{
  "uid": "cojam-inicio",
  "title": "CoJam: comece aqui",
  "description": "Resumo de uma tela: o CoJam está no ar, está sendo usado e está com erro?",
  "tags": [
    "cojam",
    "inicio"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds_prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "regex": "/^Prometheus$/",
        "hide": 2,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "name": "ds_loki",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 2,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "cojam"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "title": "Dashboards do CoJam",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como usar",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Tudo verde = nada a fazer.** Cada número tem uma explicação no ícone de informação do painel.\n\n- **[CoJam: negócio](/d/cojam-negocio)**: salas, quem entra, o que toca, pulos, retenção.\n- **[CoJam: erros](/d/cojam-erros)**: erros nos logs, RPCs que falharam, provedores, navegador, cota do YouTube.\n- **[CoJam: sistema](/d/cojam-sistema)**: latência, conexões, memória, banco, dessincronia, web vitals.\n\nDúvida de como ler algo? Veja `docs/observability.md` (tabela \"Pergunta e onde olhar\")."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Servidor no ar",
      "description": "Normal: NO AR. Preocupante: FORA por mais de 5 minutos (o alerta CoJamServerDown dispara).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "max(up{job=\"cojam-server\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "FORA",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "NO AR",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertas disparando",
      "description": "Normal: 0. Preocupante: qualquer valor acima de 0. Cada alerta tem um passo a passo em docs/observability.md.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname=~\"CoJam.*\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Erros no log (24 h)",
      "description": "Linhas de erro do servidor nas últimas 24 horas. Normal: 0 ou poucos. Preocupante: dezenas ou o mesmo erro se repetindo. Abra CoJam: erros.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds_loki}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds_loki}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container_name=\"cojam-server\"} |= `\"level\":\"ERROR\"` [24h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pessoas conectadas agora",
      "description": "Conexões abertas neste instante (uma pessoa com duas abas conta 2). 0 de madrugada é normal.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(music_jam_connections_active{job=\"cojam-server\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Salas ativas agora",
      "description": "Salas carregadas na memória do servidor, inclusive vazias até o descarte automático.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(music_jam_rooms_active{job=\"cojam-server\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Salas criadas hoje",
      "description": "Desde a meia-noite de Brasília. Fonte: eventos de produto no Postgres.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "cojam-postgres"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "cojam-postgres"
          },
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) AS \"Salas\" FROM product_events WHERE name = 'room_created' AND at >= (date_trunc('day', now() AT TIME ZONE 'America/Sao_Paulo') AT TIME ZONE 'America/Sao_Paulo')",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dessincronia p95 (30 min)",
      "description": "95% das pessoas estão com diferença menor que este valor entre o que ouvem e o que deveriam ouvir. Normal: abaixo de 1,5 s. Preocupante: acima de 5 s. Sem amostras = ninguém ouvindo ou telemetria desligada.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(music_jam_sync_drift_seconds_bucket{job=\"cojam-server\"}[30m])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "noValue": "sem amostras",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cota do YouTube",
      "description": "Aberta = o YouTube recusou por cota e o servidor parou de buscar. A cota diária zera às 04:00 de Brasília. Veja CoJam: erros para o histórico.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "max(music_jam_youtube_quota_open{job=\"cojam-server\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "ABERTA (busca bloqueada)",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 9
    }
  ]
}
